UPDATE questions SET
  stem = 'Clearwater Corp. acquired 55% of the voting common stock of Ridgemont LLC on March 1, 2025, for $4.2 million. Clearwater''s controller is preparing the year-end financial statements and asks whether Ridgemont must be included in Clearwater''s consolidated financial statements. Under ASC 810, consolidation is generally required when one entity holds:',
  choices = '["Any ownership interest exceeding 20% of the investee''s outstanding voting shares","A controlling financial interest, typically more than 50% of voting shares","Exactly 50% ownership, creating a joint control arrangement with the investee","Only 100% ownership, meaning the subsidiary is wholly owned by the parent"]',
